  [1mMy recommendation is B.[0m It answers "which services are failing" at a glance, keeps the reasons that let you act on a
  failure, and keeps the table one line per service. Optionally, the heading could also count unhealthy services
  ([38;5;153mproduction: 10 services, 3 unhealthy, as of …[39m).
